From 2fc661dc53a62562c0baf1f8f30f4003c0af0620 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NIHON <nihon@learnhns.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 17:51:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add TOTP-gated MAST recovery leaf; fix src/tests/examples
 layout

- New totp.py: per-time-step Schnorr keypairs (HMAC-derived) as MAST
  leaves, so a live authenticator code becomes a signature-bound
  script-path condition instead of a bare, replayable code.
- hns_covenant.py: NameOutputSpec now accepts totp=TotpLeafSet(...)
  alongside recovery_leaves; leaves get merged into one tree.
- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md: new section on time-sync window tradeoffs,
  TOTP secret management, and why a ZK proof is the real end state
  for this leaf (with the leaf-per-step version usable today without
  it, since it's plain Schnorr + MAST, same as everything else here).
- Fixed repo layout: moved implementation into src/hns_taproot/,
  tests into tests/, demo into examples/ -- setup.py and the existing
  test files already assumed this layout (sys.path insert of 'src',
  'pytest tests/', 'python examples/...' in README) but the published
  repo had everything flat at root, so tests/install didn't actually
  work. Fixed to match what was already documented.
- New examples/demo_totp_recovery.py and tests/test_totp.py (12 new
  tests). Full suite: 22 passed.
